# Real Estate & Construction Trust Platform

## Comprehensive Product Requirements Document (PRD)

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 1. Product Vision

To build a trusted digital infrastructure for property buying,
construction management, and supplier marketplaces, with a strong focus
on transparency, accountability, and diaspora confidence in emerging
markets.

Inspired by: - Procore (construction project management) - Property24
(property marketplace) - Upwork (contractor marketplace) - Alibaba
(supplier marketplace)

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 2. Problem Statement

### 2.1 Property Market Problems

-   Double selling of land
-   Fake or incomplete documentation
-   No ownership history transparency
-   Unscrupulous agents
-   Lack of buyer education
-   No fraud reporting infrastructure

### 2.2 Construction Problems

-   No cost visibility
-   No reliable project managers
-   No verified supplier database
-   No material price transparency
-   Poor communication
-   Budget overruns
-   Delays without accountability

### 2.3 Diaspora Problems

-   Buyer not onsite
-   No trust in reporting
-   No centralized audit trail
-   High fraud risk
-   Poor legal recourse

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 3. Core Modules

1.  Property Marketplace\
2.  Construction Project Management\
3.  Contractor & Professional Marketplace\
4.  Supplier Marketplace\
5.  Financial & Escrow System\
6.  Trust & Identity System\
7.  Monitoring & Verification System\
8.  Communication & Documentation Hub\
9.  Analytics & Risk Engine\
10. Lifecycle & Property Management

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 4. Functional Requirements

### MODULE 1: Property Marketplace

-   Property listings (land, residential, commercial, off-plan)
-   Title deed upload and verification workflow
-   Verification badges (Verified / Pending / Unverified)
-   Ownership history tracking
-   Agent profiles with ratings
-   Fraud reporting system

### MODULE 2: Construction Project Management

-   Project dashboard (budget vs actual, timeline, milestones)
-   Budget baseline and change order management
-   Milestone-based payment approvals
-   Bill of Quantities generator

### MODULE 3: Contractor Marketplace

-   Contractor profiles with certifications
-   Project bidding system
-   Performance metrics (completion %, budget adherence, disputes)

### MODULE 4: Supplier Marketplace

-   Supplier verification
-   Product catalog with pricing
-   RFQ (Request for Quotation) system
-   Delivery tracking with geo-tagged proof

### MODULE 5: Financial & Escrow System

-   Multi-currency escrow wallet
-   Milestone-based fund release
-   Full transaction audit trail
-   Budget overrun alerts

### MODULE 6: Trust & Identity System

-   KYC verification for all service providers
-   Reputation scoring engine

### MODULE 7: Monitoring & Verification

-   Geo-tagged, timestamped progress uploads
-   Independent site inspection booking
-   Immutable progress records

### MODULE 8: Communication Hub

-   Centralized project messaging
-   Version-controlled document vault
-   Digital change order approvals

### MODULE 9: Analytics & Risk Engine

-   Project Risk Score
-   Property Risk Score
-   Material Price Index (cement, bricks, steel)

### MODULE 10: Lifecycle Management

-   Warranty tracking
-   Maintenance scheduling
-   Rental management system

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 5. Non-Functional Requirements

-   End-to-end encryption
-   Role-based access control
-   Cloud-native scalable architecture
-   Regulatory compliance (financial & data protection)
-   99.5% uptime target

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 6. Monetization Model

-   Property sale commission
-   Escrow transaction fees
-   Contractor subscription plans
-   Supplier marketplace commission
-   Premium verification fees
-   Data analytics subscriptions

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 7. MVP Scope (Phase 1)

-   Verified property listings
-   Contractor profiles
-   Basic project dashboard
-   Milestone payments (manual escrow)
-   Geo-tagged progress uploads
-   Document vault
-   Basic rating system

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 8. Success Metrics

-   Reduction in fraud incidents
-   Verified listing ratio
-   Average project cost variance
-   Escrow transaction volume
-   Active diaspora users

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 9. Long-Term Vision

-   National property data authority
-   Risk scoring standard for lenders
-   API integration with banks and government
-   Construction price benchmark authority
-   Financial services expansion

------------------------------------------------------------------------

**Positioning Statement:**\
A digital trust infrastructure for real estate and construction in
emerging markets.
